Package: directCareScenarios
Title: Shared Saved-Scenario Persistence for directCare Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Anthony W.", "Raborn", , "anthony@raborndecisionsciences.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared database access layer, and a shared Save/Load Shiny
    module, for named scenario slots (3 per practice, per feature area) in
    the shared Postgres database used by both directCareAnalytics and
    directCarePlanner -- Launch Planner plan inputs, DCA Quick Calculator
    inputs, and DCA's full Upload -> Projections forecast snapshots. The
    database functions take an already-open DBI connection (see
    directCareAuth::db_connect()); the mod_scenario_slots_*() Shiny module
    owns the Save/Load modals and banner, driven by host-app callbacks for
    anything scenario-specific.
